// Kendra is the managed search index for a team that wants an index and
// still not a knowledge-base pipeline. It returns ranked results; it does
// not run the conversation or the identity federation. For a user-scoped
// conversational answer, that is work Q Business already does, so Kendra is
// the wrong reach here even though it is a real product.

